  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5849\" src=\"/media/archive/ce219c394f47e2c7fa58948e5836c3d21488689360e9ef300372cbd4c8ea0d8c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-ff018cd9606c9d21e3a0/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Image</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2022-01-22T16:57:08-05:00\" title=\"Saturday, January 22, 2022, 4:57 pm\">January 22, 2022</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<div dir=\"auto\">     New show at the Cooperative Bank in East Harwich. Come and meet the staff. Chris Caltaldo is the Bank Manager and Carrol Bradley is the Assistant Branch Manager.  Also be sure to meet the tellers Najma, Margo, Kristina, and Tyler.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">     Showing artists are Katherine Vacca, Natalie Stafford, and Joy George.  We will be planning a reception in March for this show.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Let me know when you are ready to be part of the venue at the Cooperative Bank.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Thank you, Sedona</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5850\" src=\"/media/archive/23d7e5455f83c5dbd0edac24ba93572da603899e93ff221d4a73af76f7b1c17a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5851\" src=\"/media/archive/14de218418a3fb7f694b99a1653001bf7bac8538d56b8a4247c196ca71fd9729.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5852\" src=\"/media/archive/de5c3258c2571de3ec19b23c8672ce9ec6dd7cbd59a8b75dc38d39962bc471dc.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" 